```
`pickBestTree` is named only in that intended new string. Do not invent that it exists, that `byUuid` / `byCode` exist in the file, or that this edit landed. The 6:46 search and the unreturned offset-125 read do not print `taskService.ts`. `taskService.ts` still has no printed line.

